OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be mostly cloudy with showers
OL,7,Fspreading eastwards, some of these may
OL,8,Fbe heavy. These showers will continue
OL,9,Fovernight. Increasingly strong
OL,10,Fsouthwesterly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FA mostly cloudy morning with
OL,13,Fshowers. Cloudy in the afternoon with
OL,14,Fa heavier band of more persistent rain
OL,15,Fspreading southeastwards. Strong winds
OL,16,Fwill ease later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
