OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fon Sunday with outbreaks of rain,
OL,7,Fheavy and wintry at times. Mostly
OL,8,Fcloudy on Monday and Tuesday with
OL,9,Fheavy, blustery showers at times.
